# An allowlist: the build context is exactly what the `Dockerfile` copies, and nothing else: no `.env`, no
# `certs/*.pem` from a local Compose run, no `.git`, and no editable-install `.so` or Rust `target/` that would slip
# into a wheel built from source.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
!rust-toolchain.toml
!wrappers/py/README.md
!apps/sdk/native/
!src/
apps/sdk/native/target
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.so
**/*.pyd
